content:
$13,563.60 - $6,879.98 = $6,683.62. Confirm this against the checking balance growth from $18,200 in January to $44,939.28 in April, a total increase of $26,739.28 over 4 months, averaging $6,684.82 per month.
</7>
<8>
title: "Calculate the tax shortfall reserve by taking the $10,150.80 owed at filing from the 1040 and dividing by..."
