content:
QBI deduction = lesser of (20% x $43,258.84 = $8,651.77) and the 20%-of-taxable-income limit (20% x $28,258.84 = $5,651.77) = $5,651.77 (the limit binds). Note the 2025 return omitted this deduction in error; the 2026 projection must claim it.
