title: "[Calculation] Every gym call needs an actual answer, keep or kill, with a reason"
content:
Every gym call needs an actual answer, keep or kill, with a reason. They said don't hand me a maybe. So no "it depends" on OTF, Anytime, or Planet.
</13>
