{
  "variant": "warning",
  "title": "Track as you go",
  "content": "Don't wait until the end of the week! Track your time spent tasking in real time in your HAI Dashboard to ensure accuracy, honesty, and avoid payment delays.",
  "actions": [
    { "variant": "outline", "text": "Time Tracking Guide", "href": "https://ai-support.joinhandshake.com/articles/32263198491031" },
    { "variant": "outline", "text": "Time Tracking Policy", "href": "https://ai-support.joinhandshake.com/articles/37147782534167" }
  ]
}
\`\`\`

You'll use one platform:

- **Handshake AI**: where you claim tasks, complete tasks, track your time, and submit your work

\`\`\`step-sequence
<1>
title: Claim a task
content: Open your Project Details page in Handshake AI and claim a task.
</1>
<2>
title: Review the task instructions
content: After you claim the task, review the instructions carefully before you begin.
</2>
<3>
title: Work within the platform
content: Complete the task directly in Handshake AI. Track your time as you go.
</3>
<4>
title: Submit the task
content: Once your work is complete, answer any required questions, and submit the task in Handshake AI.
</4>
<5>
title: Confirm your time
content: Confirm your tracked time, edit if it's inaccurate, and click Submit Task to log your work.
</5>
\`\`\`

\`\`\`accordion
<1>
id: pending-earnings
title: Why aren't my pending earnings updating after I submit tasks?
content:
Sometimes pending earnings take a bit longer to update. Your dashboard should update before the next pay cycle as the system syncs. Once the update completes, your earnings will reflect correctly.

If your earnings don't update accurately and the pay cycle has passed, please visit our [Help Center](https://ai-support.joinhandshake.com/), or select "Support" in the upper right hand corner of your [Handshake AI dashboard](https://ai.joinhandshake.com/fellow/projects).
</1>
<2>
id: submit-timesheet
title: Do I need to submit a timesheet?
content: No. Your time is tracked automatically when you claim and submit tasks on the platform in Handshake AI.
</2>
<3>
id: incorrect-timer
title: What should I do if my timer is showing the incorrect time?
content:
If your timer shows the incorrect time, it may mean you were idle and left it running in the background, or that the timer did not start correctly. After you submit your task, you'll have the option to edit the time spent on the task.

**Note:** You only have one chance to edit your time, so please make sure it is correct before final submission. Submitted tasks cannot be edited retroactively.
  </3>
\`\`\`
